      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "Ceres Fauna (1st costume)",
      "excerpt": "The default costume of [[hololive English]]'s [[Ceres Fauna]].\r\n\r\nShe wears a [[layered dress]] consisting of a [[short dress|short]] [[blue dress|dark blue]] [[strapless dress|strapless]] [[backless dress|backless]] inner layer with a [[frilled skirt|frilled]] [[skirt under dress|skirt underneath]], and a [[white dress|white]] and [[pink dress|pink]] [[two-sided dress]] outer layer with an opening that goes [[framed breasts|around]] and [[underbust|under]] the chest area, [[long sleeves|long]] [[wide sleeves]] with [[shoulder cutout]]s a  [[detached collar]] with a [[blue bowtie]], and a [[high-low skirt]]. She also wears a [[blue gloves|blue]] [[single bridal gauntlet]], a [[single thighhigh|single]] [[stirrup legwear|stirrup]] [[white thighhighs|white thighhigh]] on her left leg and an [[anklet]] on her right leg.\r\n\r\nOn March 2023, she got an update for this outfit that allows her to replace the outer dress with a [[high-waist skirt]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #4725523: Reference sheet\r\n* !post #4723678: Live2D",
